<title>RUSSIA: TENNIS-MARTINEZ BEATS PAULUS TO WIN KREMLIN CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MARTINEZ BEATS PAULUS TO WIN KREMLIN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the final of the $400,000 Kremlin Cup womens' tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding): 1-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat 2-Barbara Paulus (Austria) 6-1 4-6 6-4</p>
</text>
